  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7506.03 Scope of Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7506.03 Scope of Hearing.\n\n(a) The scope of hearing shall be limited to whether the license holder has the ability to pay the security amount in full, and if not:\n\n(1) Amount of periodic payment;\n\n(2) Frequency of payments; and\n\n(3) Duration of payments.\n\nSource. #13938, eff 4-24-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 7500)",
